@startuml CD2 — Payment & Coupon
title SmartStays — Class Diagram (Part 2: Payment & Coupon)

skinparam classBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
skinparam classBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam arrowColor #4A6FA5
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum DiscountType {
  PERCENT
  FLAT
}

enum PaymentStatus {
  PENDING
  SUCCESS
  FAILED
  REFUNDED
}

class Booking {
  +Long id
  +String bookingConfirmationCode
  +String status
}

class Payment {
  +Long id
  +BigDecimal amount
  +String currency
  +String paymentGateway
  +String status
  +LocalDateTime paidAt
}

class Coupon {
  +Long id
  +String code
  +DiscountType discountType
  +BigDecimal discountValue
  +BigDecimal minBookingAmount
  +BigDecimal maxDiscountCap
  +LocalDate validFrom
  +LocalDate validUntil
  +int usageLimit
  +int timesUsed
  +boolean isActive
}

class CancellationPolicy {
  +Long id
  +String name
  +boolean isFreeCancel
  +Integer freeCancellationHoursBefore
  +Integer partialRefundPercentage
  +String policyDescription
}

Booking "1" --> "0..*" Payment : paid via
Coupon --> DiscountType : uses
Payment --> PaymentStatus : has status
Booking "0..*" --> "1" CancellationPolicy : governed by

@enduml
